<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- MedPartners started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- MedPartners started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Chicago Corp said it initiated coverage of MedPartners Inc on Tuesday with a buy rating and a price target of $30.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Corp said MedPartners has the most compelling risk/reward profile in the physician practice management industry because its earnings risk is lower than its competitors. Concern about MedPartners' growth and acquisition assimilation are exaggerated, Chicago Corp said in a report.</p>
<p>-- MedPartners stock is up 1/4 at 22-1/8.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
